[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 5220.39, "timestamp": "01:27:00", "text": "只是，嗯，因为你有，呃，你的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5222.95, "timestamp": "01:27:02", "text": "所以，你的智慧值在这里是加三。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5225.35, "timestamp": "01:27:05", "text": "正确的？这意味着所有的智慧"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5227.75, "timestamp": "01:27:07", "text": "物品加三分。然后是你的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5229.35, "timestamp": "01:27:09", "text": "智力为零。这意味着"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5230.95, "timestamp": "01:27:10", "text": "所有情报方面的东西都加分了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5232.87, "timestamp": "01:27:12", "text": "零。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5234.95, "timestamp": "01:27:14", "text": "哦，太好了。如果你查看技能"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5236.55, "timestamp": "01:27:16", "text": "熟练掌握意味着你将获得另一个"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5239.27, "timestamp": "01:27:19", "text": "再加上两个。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5241.27, "timestamp": "01:27:21", "text": "哦好的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5244.55, "timestamp": "01:27:24", "text": "哦。呃，所以如果我点击“选择”按钮的话。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5246.31, "timestamp": "01:27:26", "text": "其他"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5249.99, "timestamp": "01:27:29", "text": "呃，智慧一，它将变成加六"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5253.669, "timestamp": "01:27:33", "text": "或者加四，对吧？呃，不。更甚"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5257.51, "timestamp": "01:27:37", "text": "比如，因为，嗯，技能是如何运作的？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5262.47, "timestamp": "01:27:42", "text": "你的技能需要你的能力"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5265.11, "timestamp": "01:27:45", "text": "分数修正值，比如说，如果它是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5267.11, "timestamp": "01:27:47", "text": "智慧是加三，然后需要"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5268.87, "timestamp": "01:27:48", "text": "你的熟练加值。意思是像"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5270.79, "timestamp": "01:27:50", "text": "你很擅长那件事。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5273.43, "timestamp": "01:27:53", "text": "你的熟练加值初始为2，但"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5275.189, "timestamp": "01:27:55", "text": "然后它会随着你的等